Subject: [PATCH 08/13] customkimi: show OpenRouter's balance and session cost
 in the footer

OpenRouter is the third billing provider. The balance comes from /credits with the management key (environment, else the macOS Keychain, never exported into Kimi's environment), else from the API key's limit_remaining; prices from the public model list cover replies without usage.cost. Tests blank the provider key variables so the footer never polls real balances.
